.TH RHYTHMCAT 1 "2026-10-29" "RhythmCat 3.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rhythmcat \- music player (GTK 4 frontend)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rhythmcat
.RI [ OPTION ...]
.RI [ FILE ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rhythmcat
is the GTK 4 frontend of the RhythmCat music player. It plays music,
manages the music library and user playlists, reads CUE sheets and
playlist files (M3U, M3U8, PLS, XSPF), shows synchronized lyrics and has
a 10-band equalizer.
.PP
Audio files, CUE sheets, playlist files and folders given as
.I FILE
arguments are imported into the music library.
.PP
Only one frontend of RhythmCat can run at the same time. If another one
is already running, an error message is shown.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show the help options.
.TP
.B \-\-help\-all
Show all help options.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/RhythmCat3/settings.conf
The settings.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/RhythmCat3/library.json.gz
The music library and the playlists.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rhythmcat\-tui (1)
